  "body_text": "Skip to Main Content Business About Advice FAQ Reviews Therapist jobs Contact Log in Get started \"I dwell in possibility.\" Emily Dickinson Sign in with Google or Email Address Send reset password email Back to login Previous \"Roberto is a great therapist. He listens to my concerns and provides good feedback and ideas to resolve emotional issues. Thank you.\" - Written 14 days ago Client review for Roberto Diaz LMHC, LPC \"Angela is exactly the kind of therapist I was hoping to work with. Angela is not afraid to give practical homework and ask pointed questions. I could not be happier, both during and after my sessions, as I know I am always working towards a goal.\" - Written 14 days ago Client review for Angela DaSilva LCSW \"Ashley is wonderful. I have been with her for a few years now and I have always appreciated her expertise and support. It has helped me tremendously and I appreciate her so much!\" - Written 30 days ago Client review for Ashley Brummett LCSW \"She was very sweet and kind and understanding as well. I liked talking to her. I could feel that she truly cares. Thank you Ms. Joyner.\" - Written 11 days ago Client review for Jeanette Joyner LCSW-R \"Latrice actively listens and offers empathetic, helpful feedback that is helping me make progress towards my mental health goals.\" - Written 13 days ago Client review for Latrice Todd LPC \"I am so very thankful for the time I have with Thomas. He is very professional honest and provided me with so many resources and tools to become a better me.\" - Written 13 days ago Client review for Thomas Moore LCSW \"Feel seen and heard- Bryan provides practical advice; he is compassionate and very thorough with his therapeutic approach. Thank you!\" - Written 15 days ago Client review for Bryan Hixson LCSW Next 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 If you are in a crisis or any other person may be in danger - don't use this site. These resources can provide you with immediate help. Terms & Conditions Privacy Policy Health Data Do Not Sell My Information Web Accessibility © 2026 BetterHelp Cookie Consent We process personally identifiable and personal health information to conduct our business, as described in our Privacy Policy. Some data processing and sharing is required for our business to function. By clicking \"I agree\" we may share PII with third party advertising partners to deliver relevant ads or analytics partners to improve our services. To learn more or to opt-out go to \"Sharing settings\". Sharing settings I agree",
